  m_Name: Guide_ModelSelectionIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GuideDialogueSet
  lines:
  - Here are our wonderful ladies!
  - Each of them has her own musical taste. Lord, forgive us...
  - The more sites you unlock, the better the lady available to you.
  - We all started with a training one, to survive the first day and figure out how
    things work.
  - You must always improve, or leave!
